  "description": "This is a beautiful, elegant white wine sauce that will go with virtually any fish. The simple restaurant trick we deploy here is to mix in cold cubes of butter which makes the sauce glossy and satiny.  You need to pan fry because the fond left in the pan after pan frying dissolves into the sauce and adds flavour.",
